Forward-looking statements are subject to a number of risks, uncertainties and assumptions. Matters and factors that could cause actual results to differ materially from those expressed or implied in such forward-looking statements include but are not limited to the matters and factors described in Item 1A, “Risk Factors” of this Annual Report, as well as statements about or relating to or otherwise affected by:

•our ability to meet our existing short-term and long-term debt obligations with the Company’s current projected operating cash flows in the long term;

